之始臣等並卽經見加推糾案入主書方被却檢疏謬之諐伏追震悚","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd:p016:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"侃","person_id":"8qc_zx3_yzg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd:p016:u0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"臣等","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"王逡之等議奏，未列所有參議者。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":"cbr-ai-transcription-sha256:d752793ccca569b28429b050d8c65fdbf97b11cc0c1a900dea28b4c8bc588dcc","source_layer":"received_biography","column_projection":[{"pdf_page":106,"half":"右","leaf":"四下","column_from_right":5,"start":2,"end":21,"text":"侃奏彈之始臣等並卽經見加推糾案入主書方"},{"pdf_page":106,"half":"右","leaf":"四下","column_from_right":6,"start":0,"end":11,"text":"被却檢疏謬之諐伏追震悚"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd","book_id":"b-nanqishu-036","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p013","text":"今月九日，治書侍御史臣司馬侃啓彈征北諮議參軍事謝超宗，稱「根性昏動，率心險放，悖議爽眞，囂辭犯實，親朋忍聞，衣冠掩目，輙收付廷尉法獄治罪」。處劾雖重，文辭簡略，事入主書，被却還外。其晚，兼御史中丞臣袁彖改奏白簡，始粗詳備。厥初隱衞，寔彖之由。尋超宗植性險戾，稟行凶詖，豺狼野心，久暴遐邇。張敬兒潛圖反噬，罰未塞諐，而稱怨痛枉，形于言貌。協附姦邪，疑閒勳烈，構扇異端，譏議時政，行路同忿，有心咸疾。而阿昧苟容，輕文略奏。又彈事舊體，品第不簡，而釁戾殊常者，皆命議親奏，以彰深。況超宗罪愈四凶，過窮南竹，雖下輙收，而文止黃案，沈浮旡見，輕重相乖，此而不糾，憲綱將替。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p013:m0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"司馬侃","person_id":"8qc_zx3_yzg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p013:m0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"謝超宗","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p013:m0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"袁彖","person_id":"x6r_6az_6zn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p013:m0117","start":117,"end":118,"surface":"彖","person_id":"x6r_6az_6zn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p013:m0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"超宗","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p013:m0144","start":144,"end":147,"surface":"張敬兒","person_id":"stv_g27_gl2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p013:m0239","start":239,"end":241,"surface":"超宗","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p013:u0243","start":243,"end":245,"surface":"四凶","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"王逡之用古代四凶為比喻。"}],"source_position":{"raw_start":1607,"raw_end":1889,"raw_character_offsets":[1607,1608,1609,1610,1611,1612,1613,1614,1615,1616,1617,1618,1619,1620,1621,1622,1623,1624,1625,1626,1627,1628,1629,1630,1631,1632,1633,1634,1635,1636,1637,1638,1639,1640,1641,1642,1643,1644,1645,1646,1647,1648,1649,1650,1651,1652,1653,1654,1655,1656,1657,1658,1659,1660,1661,1662,1663,1664,1665,1666,1667,1668,1669,1670,1671,1672,1673,1674,1675,1676,1677,1678,1679,1680,1681,1682,1683,1684,1685,1686,1687,1688,1689,1690,1691,1692,1693,1694,1695,1696,1697,1698,1699,1700,1701,1702,1703,1704,1705,1706,1707,1708,1709,1710,1711,1712,1713,1714,1715,1716,1717,1718,1719,1720,1721,1722,1723,1724,1725,1726,1727,1728,1729,1730,1731,1732,1733,1734,1735,1736,1737,1738,1739,1740,1741,1742,1743,1744,1745,1746,1747,1748,1749,1750,1751,1752,1753,1754,1755,1756,1757,1758,1759,1760,1761,1762,1763,1764,1765,1766,1767,1768,1769,1770,1771,1772,1773,1774,1775,1776,1777,1778,1779,1780,1781,1782,1783,1784,1785,1786,1787,1788,